      "message": "According to the RMCv2 specification \"CAN Bus Cables\" Chapter:\n\n\u003eFor CAN Bus, RMCv2 uses a custom 1-to-32 daisy-cahin RJ45 cable. This cable below provides a multi-drop bus where RMCv2 can be connected to 32 endpoint trays per port. With 8 ports on RMCv2, this gives access to 256 endpoints.",
